facts:
A factor to the power $1$ **cuts** the axis, crossing it like a straight line.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.4,0)--(4.4,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.4)--(0,3.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-1.4:3.8,smooth,variable=\x,samples=70] plot ({\x},{0.5*(\x-1.2)+0.05*(\x-1.2)*(\x-1.2)*(\x-1.2)});
\fill (1.2,0) circle (2pt);
\node[below right] at (1.2,0) {$x=a$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A factor to the power $2$ **bounces**, touching the axis without crossing it.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.4,0)--(4.4,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-1.4)--(0,3.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-1.4:3.8,smooth,variable=\x,samples=70] plot ({\x},{0.4*(\x-1.2)*(\x-1.2)});
\fill (1.2,0) circle (2pt);
\node[below right] at (1.2,0) {$x=a$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A factor to the power $3$ **inflects**, flattening along the axis as it crosses.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.4,0)--(4.4,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.4)--(0,3.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-1.4:3.8,smooth,variable=\x,samples=70] plot ({\x},{0.16*(\x-1.2)*(\x-1.2)*(\x-1.2)});
\fill (1.2,0) circle (2pt);
\node[below right] at (1.2,0) {$x=a$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

If the degree is **even**, the two ends of the graph point in the same direction.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-4.2,0)--(4.2,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-2.4)--(0,3.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-3.3:3.3,smooth,variable=\x,samples=90] plot ({\x},{0.10*\x*\x*\x*\x-0.9*\x*\x+0.5});
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

If the degree is **odd**, the two ends point in different directions.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-4.2,0)--(4.2,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.4)--(0,3.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-3.4:3.4,smooth,variable=\x,samples=70] plot ({\x},{0.16*\x*\x*\x-1.0*\x});
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

