mastery.question_text:
The polynomial graphed below has leading coefficient $1$ or $-1$. Write its equation in factored form.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-2.5,0)--(3.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.4)--(0,3.4) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-1.8:3,smooth,variable=\x,samples=150] plot ({\x},{0.1*(\x+1)*(\x+1)*(\x-2)*(\x-2)*(\x-2)});
\fill (-1,0) circle (2pt);
\node[above] at (-1,0) {$-1$};
\fill (2,0) circle (2pt);
\node[above] at (2,0) {$2$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
